<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank offers 13-week bills at maximum 12.4%.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank offers 13-week bills at maximum 12.4%.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Wednesday it would hold a Dutch auction offering five billion crowns ($170.5 million) in 13-week central bank liquidity bills on Thursday, with maximum gross yield on bids set at 12.4 percent.</p>
<p>The maximum yield is unchanged from the most recent auction of similar bills last week.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003 ($ = 29.33 Czech Crowns)</p>
